<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's Riksbank sees room for crown to firm.</title>
<headline>Sweden's Riksbank sees room for crown to firm.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, said on Monday it saw room for the crown to strengthen.</p>
